sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant S as AddSymptomScreen
  participant P as SymptomsProvider
  participant D as Dio + AuthInterceptor
  participant F as FirebaseAuth
  participant B as Backend (/api/v1/symptoms)
  participant DB as Database

  U->>S: Tap "Save Symptom"
  S->>P: addSymptom(symptom)
  P->>D: POST /api/v1/symptoms
  D->>F: getIdToken()
  F-->>D: JWT token
  D->>B: Request with Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
  B->>B: Verify token + validate payload
  B->>DB: Insert symptom
  DB-->>B: Created row
  B-->>D: 201 Created + symptom JSON
  D-->>P: ChronicSymptom
  P-->>S: success = true
  S-->>U: Show success and navigate back

  alt Backend unavailable or auth fails
    B-->>D: 401 / 5xx or network error
    D-->>P: throws error
    P-->>S: success = false
    S-->>U: Show failure state (recommended)
  end
